OL,3,GNEWSATwo teenagers in hospital with
OL,4,Ameningitis B
OL,5,
OL,6,FUKHSA said it had "been undertaking
OL,7,Fextensive contact-tracing to identify
OL,8,Fclose contacts of the teenagers" and
OL,9,F"as a precautionary measure, those
OL,10,Fidentified have been offered
OL,11,Fantibiotics and given information on
OL,12,Fthe signs and symptoms of meningitis B
OL,13,Fto look out for."
